                "_type": "Diesel Product Detail",
                "about": {
                    "image": {
                        "src": "https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-hotelrenovator-twohorizons-s2-1200x1600-3f471995a208.jpg",
                        "_type": "Diesel Image"
                    },
                    "developerAttribution": "Two Horizons",
                    "_type": "Diesel Product About",
                    "publisherAttribution": "Focus Entertainment",
                    "description": "The Hotel Renovator Five Star Edition includes the base game and a pack of 7 DLC to be released in the upcoming months. \n\nUnleash your inner designer and renovate the hotel of your dreams! Embark on a makeover journey to turn this worn-out place into a successful getaway. Play with thousands of furniture pieces and accessories, and manage the hotel to get 5-star reviews!\n\nExpand your inner designer experience with 7 packs featuring amazing decoration items that will make your hotel stand out from the rest. Customize your hotel with new sets of furniture and rooms!\n\n# The Five Star Edition currently includes:\n• The Palace Furniture Set \n• Kawaii Furniture Set \n• Futuristic Furniture Set\n• Gym Furniture Set\n• Steampunk Furniture Set\n• Disco Room & Furniture Set\n• Indoor Garden Room & Furniture Set",
                    "shortDescription": "The Hotel Renovator Five Star Edition includes the base game and a pack of 7 DLC to be released in the upcoming months. Expand your inner designer experience with 7 packs featuring amazing decoration items that will make your hotel stand out from the rest.",
